# USEP repository: definitions only (code, ontology, harnesses, policies, IaC, ADRs).
# Runtime data never goes in Git: knowledge stores, evidence, events, secrets, keys, run state.

# ---- Secrets, keys, credentials (Vault references only; HLD 8, LLD 2.7) ----
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.crt
*.cer
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
*.gpg
/secrets/
*.secret
*.secrets
credentials*
!credentials.example*
vault-token*
.vault-token
kubeconfig*
*.kubeconfig
service-account*.json
.aws/
.azure/
.gcloud/

# ---- Runtime data: stores, evidence, events, packages, run state ----
# PostgreSQL, Neo4j, pgvector, Kafka and WORM evidence are provisioned from platform-iac and never stored here.
